The artifact is a complete posterior-predictive replay of a predecessor fitted
only to the supplied observations and priors. It is a prediction snapshot for
these fixed query descriptions, not a collection of ground-truth labels.
`python run.py --output OUTPUT_DIRECTORY` emits the runnable baseline submission.
